LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 3)
# Example 7.1 (mixture density 0.05 g/cm3) -- OH-initiated oxidation of methanol in dense water, ReaxFF (real units)
# 32 CH3OH + 64 OH radicals + 200 H2O in a cubic periodic box whose size sets the mass density of the mixture.
# The OH radicals are inserted as the initial reactive species (they stand for the radical pool of supercritical
# water oxidation). T = 2500 K is used because (i) at 1500 K the CHO-2008 water is not a homogeneous fluid at
# 0.1-0.3 g/cm3 (it separates into a dense droplet and voids, and its pressure does not follow the density) and
# (ii) the methanol conversion at 1500 K is too slow to be observed in tens of picoseconds.
# usage:  lmp -in in.reax                      (run inside the folder rho<value>/; mpirun -np 4 lmp -in in.reax)
# files:  ffield.reax.cho (Chenoweth et al. 2008, distributed with LAMMPS), methanol.mol, oh.mol, water.mol
units           real
atom_style      charge
boundary        p p p

variable        rho     index 0.05       # mass density of the mixture, g/cm3
variable        T       index 2500       # K
variable        nM      index 32         # CH3OH
variable        nOH     index 64         # OH radicals
variable        nW      index 200        # H2O
variable        seed    index 20261
variable        nsteps  index 120000     # 30 ps at 0.25 fs

variable        M       equal v_nM*32.042+v_nOH*17.007+v_nW*18.015      # total mass in amu
variable        L       equal (v_M*1.66054/v_rho)^(1.0/3.0)             # box edge in Angstrom
region          box block 0 ${L} 0 ${L} 0 ${L}
region          box block 0 57.4747701036105 0 ${L} 0 ${L}
region          box block 0 57.4747701036105 0 57.4747701036105 0 ${L}
region          box block 0 57.4747701036105 0 57.4747701036105 0 57.4747701036105
create_box      3 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (57.47477 57.47477 57.47477)
  2 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
molecule        meth methanol.mol
Read molecule template meth:
# methanol CH3OH
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  6 atoms with max type 3
  0 bonds with max type 0
  0 angles with max type 0
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
molecule        oh   oh.mol
Read molecule template oh:
# OH radical
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  2 atoms with max type 3
  0 bonds with max type 0
  0 angles with max type 0
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
molecule        wat  water.mol
Read molecule template wat:
# water
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  3 atoms with max type 3
  0 bonds with max type 0
  0 angles with max type 0
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
create_atoms    0 random ${nM}  ${seed} box mol meth $(v_seed+1) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 32  ${seed} box mol meth $(v_seed+1) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 32  20261 box mol meth $(v_seed+1) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 32  20261 box mol meth 20262 overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
Created 192 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (57.47477 57.47477 57.47477)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.002 seconds
create_atoms    0 random ${nOH} $(v_seed+2) box mol oh $(v_seed+3) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 64 $(v_seed+2) box mol oh $(v_seed+3) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 64 20263 box mol oh $(v_seed+3) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 64 20263 box mol oh 20264 overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
Created 128 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (57.47477 57.47477 57.47477)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds
create_atoms    0 random ${nW}  $(v_seed+4) box mol wat $(v_seed+5) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 200  $(v_seed+4) box mol wat $(v_seed+5) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 200  20265 box mol wat $(v_seed+5) overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
create_atoms    0 random 200  20265 box mol wat 20266 overlap 1.8 maxtry 5000
Created 600 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (57.47477 57.47477 57.47477)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.002 seconds
mass            1 12.011
mass            2 1.008
mass            3 15.999

pair_style      reaxff NULL
pair_coeff      * * ffield.reax.cho C H O
Reading potential file ffield.reax.cho with DATE: 2011-02-18
fix             qeq all qeq/reaxff 1 0.0 10.0 1.0e-6 reaxff
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 5 delay 0 check yes

thermo          1000
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press density
minimize        1e-6 1e-6 500 5000

